    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic platformer that focuses on a simple but dynamic combat system and puzzle solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Core</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you will not only have to run forward and defeat enemies, but sometimes you will also have to hide in the shadows, hack systems and solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Access</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will be gradually updated, adding new levels and mechanics. I will try to balance different parts of the gameplay so that the game does not slide into only action or constant puzzles.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic platformer that focuses on a simple but dynamic combat system and puzzle solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Core</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you will not only have to run forward and defeat enemies, but sometimes you will also have to hide in the shadows, hack systems and solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Access</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will be gradually updated, adding new levels and mechanics. I will try to balance different parts of the gameplay so that the game does not slide into only action or constant puzzles.</p>",
